      <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n310.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/amirah_leshatz_lifnay_birkat_kohanim/before_call"/>Our God and God of our fathers, bless us with the threefold blessing that is written in the Torah through Moses Thy servant and was uttered by the mouth of Aaron and his sons <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/kohanim"/>the priests, <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/amirah_leshatz_lifnay_birkat_kohanim/after_call"/>Thy holy people, as it is said: <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
